title: '[pallet-revive] Rollback receipt logs on frame revert'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime User
    description: |-
      Ethereum receipt logs emitted by reverted contract frames are now rolled
      back together with the frame. This prevents reverted logs from remaining
      in Ethereum-compatible receipts, blooms, and receipt roots when a nested
      call reverts.

      Logs from committed execution frames are unaffected.

crates:
  - name: pallet-revive
    bump: patch
